# Title: Microsoft Malware Protection Engine Crash - WER
# ID: 6c82cf5c-090d-4d57-9188-533577631108
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2017-05-09
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1211, attack.t1685
# Description: This rule detects a suspicious crash of the Microsoft Malware Protection Engine
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(winlog.provider_name:"Windows Error Reporting" AND winlog.event_id:"1001" AND (Data:*MsMpEng.exe* AND Data:*mpengine.dll*))
